  "packageHashAlgorithm": "SHA512",
  "packageSize": 29976,
  "projectUrl": "https://gitlab.hush-vp.ru/voluntas-progressus/network/rustly",
  "published": "2026-04-08T03:02:49.567Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "EN:\n\t\t\tVersion 10.0.0:\n\t\t\t- Result: added IsOkAnd, IsErrAnd, Contains, ContainsErr, MapOr, MapOrElse, And, Or, Ok(), Err() conversions.\n\t\t\t- Option: added IsSomeAnd, Contains, MapOr, MapOrElse, Filter, And, Or, OrElse, Xor, Zip.\n\t\t\t- Extension methods: Flatten, Transpose, ZipWith, Unzip for nested Result/Option types.\n\t\t\t- Prelude: auto-imported via build props — no manual using static needed.\n\t\t\t- Implicit operators: T → Result<T,E> and T → Option<T>.\n\t\t\t- Full Rust std::result / std::option API parity.\n\n\t\t\tRU:\n\t\t\tВерсия 10.0.0:\n\t\t\t- Result: добавлены IsOkAnd, IsErrAnd, Contains, ContainsErr, MapOr, MapOrElse, And, Or, Ok(), Err() конвертации.\n\t\t\t- Option: добавлены IsSomeAnd, Contains, MapOr, MapOrElse, Filter, And, Or, OrElse, Xor, Zip.\n\t\t\t- Extension-методы: Flatten, Transpose, ZipWith, Unzip для вложенных Result/Option.\n\t\t\t- Prelude: автоимпорт через build props — не нужен ручной using static.\n\t\t\t- Implicit operators: T → Result<T,E> и T → Option<T>.\n\t\t\t- Полный паритет API с Rust std::result / std::option.",
